# Sample fixed robot ID; add an explicit block for every commissioned robot.
user linebot-01
topic write robots/linebot-01/telemetry
topic write robots/linebot-01/status
topic write robots/linebot-01/pid/state
topic write robots/linebot-01/pid/ack
topic write robots/linebot-01/event
topic read robots/linebot-01/pid/set

user backend
topic read robots/linebot-01/telemetry
topic read robots/linebot-01/status
topic read robots/linebot-01/pid/state
topic read robots/linebot-01/pid/ack
topic read robots/linebot-01/event
topic write robots/linebot-01/pid/set
